+- **The Design Console follows**: the scenario tabs render the three containers, and the specimens that read a page context (the mobile backlog card and sheet, the matrix card, the mobile Move-to panel) render inside one with inert handlers. Verified: format, lint, typecheck, knip, the unit and integration suites, all 26 e2e tests, `npm run check:clicks` (16/16, no console errors) and a browser check of the Board's tabs on desktop and mobile.
